WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.690
- How are you feeling, first
of all, from your fall?

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.793
- I'm doing really well.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.633
It's annoying, it's my right hand.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.510
Where they did the surgery under here,

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:15.650
I kept thinking my cast
has like a boulder in it,

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.440
but it's my arm is actually kind of got

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.330
a boulder in it right there right now,

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:24.060
so it's uncomfortable, but it's temporary.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.870
In another month I'll have it off.

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:27.895
- Oh my gosh.
- And so I can't complain.

00:00:27.895 --> 00:00:29.439
(audience applause)

00:00:29.439 --> 00:00:31.620
- It's so funny that it's
like random when you get hurt.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:33.090
You're just like, "Really?"

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:35.778
I always wanna make up a
story like I saved a baby.

00:00:35.778 --> 00:00:38.720
(audience laughs)
I escaped a shark.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.537
- I never had so much fun
actually breaking a bone before.

00:00:41.537 --> 00:00:43.740
(laughing)
- Then you've never been

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:46.163
the proper amount of drunk.
(laughing)

00:00:46.163 --> 00:00:48.160
I'm just kidding, I
don't advocate alcohol.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:49.760
I'm just kidding, okay go 'head.

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:52.900
- No, but I mean I was dancing with Val,

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.320
who's so much fun and it
was actually the last time

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:58.987
that I was gonna be doing the.

00:00:58.987 --> 00:01:01.670
"Uptown Girl" was gonna be my first dance.

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:04.150
- Aww.
- And we had been practicing

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:06.797
the rumba and at the very
end of the day he goes,

00:01:06.797 --> 00:01:08.417
"You know what, just one for good measure

00:01:08.417 --> 00:01:10.630
"'cause tomorrow we do
blocking and stuff like that."

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:14.640
He said, "So let's just run
through one more 'Uptown Girl'."

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:19.420
And it was at that point
that I started the song

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:23.090
and I was just walking by and
I caught my heel of my shoe

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:26.530
and I fell down exactly wrong.

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:30.050
Like I just landed exactly wrong on my arm

00:01:30.050 --> 00:01:32.008
and the second it happened I was like,

00:01:32.008 --> 00:01:35.235
(sighs) "Oh no, I think I broke it.

00:01:35.235 --> 00:01:36.068
"I know I broke it."

